    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVXDQ1EM5EYCVA714EC\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn about the data that is synced when you integrate Boulevard with your Klaviyo account. When you integrate, we sync all historic data stored in Boulevard and then sync ongoing data in real time. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVXTVN5WJGE8EYZ3FGM\">How to view your data</h2>\n<p>To view your Boulevard data:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the <strong>Analytics</strong> dropdown in the left-hand navigation sidebar.</li>\n<li> Select <strong>Metrics</strong>. Here, you can view all of the metrics in your account. The metrics with a Boulevard icon represent all of the metrics synced from your Boulevard integration. </li>\n<li>Filter this view to see only Boulevard metrics by using the filter selector next to the search bar.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723545640987\" alt=\"List of Boulevard metrics found on the Metrics page in Klaviyo.\" width=\"220\" height=\"351\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVXEF0TC73Z5ZAF6WMR\">Appointment metrics</h2>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVXJQ1JQH19H2MHKD4Z\">Booked Appointments</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client books a new appointment.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Staff Names</strong><br>The list of staff members associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Service Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of services associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start At</strong><strong><br></strong>The start date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End At </strong><strong><br></strong>The end date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the purchase associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID associated with the location.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Duration</strong><strong><br></strong>The duration of the appointment in minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Booked By</strong><strong><br></strong>Who booked the appointment, e.g., <em>Client</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVXPG1EMFVED9NV6SQ9\">Cancelled Appointments</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client cancels their appointment.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Staff Names</strong><br>The list of staff members associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Service Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of services associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start At</strong><strong><br></strong>The start date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End At </strong><strong><br></strong>The end date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the purchase associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID associated with the location.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Duration</strong><strong><br></strong>The duration of the appointment in minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Booked By</strong><strong><br></strong>Who booked the appointment, e.g., <em>Client</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVX75VP4J3YP7Z42PFP\">Arrived for Appointments</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client checks in for their appointment.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Staff Names</strong><br>The list of staff members associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Service Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of services associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start At</strong><strong><br></strong>The start date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End At </strong><strong><br></strong>The end date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the purchase associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID associated with the location.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Duration</strong><strong><br></strong>The duration of the appointment in minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Booked By</strong><strong><br></strong>Who booked the appointment, e.g., <em>Client</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVX8BZ10MKJJDAFYHVP\">Completed Appointments</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client completes a specific appointment.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Staff Names</strong><br>The list of staff members associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Service Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of services associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start At</strong><strong><br></strong>The start date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End At </strong><strong><br></strong>The end date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the purchase associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID associated with the location.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Duration</strong><strong><br></strong>The duration of the appointment in minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Booked By</strong><strong><br></strong>Who booked the appointment, e.g., <em>Client</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVYW7YWVYPDG8T5YNR7\">Confirmed Appointments</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client confirms their appointment.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Staff Names</strong><br>The list of staff members associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Service Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of services associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start At</strong><strong><br></strong>The start date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End At </strong><strong><br></strong>The end date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the purchase associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the appointment.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID associated with the location.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Duration</strong><strong><br></strong>The duration of the appointment in minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Booked By</strong><strong><br></strong>Who booked the appointment, e.g., <em>Client</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVYAM285YP0Y58TMF89\">Rescheduled Appointments</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client reschedules their appointments.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Staff Names</strong><br>The list of staff members associated with the appointments.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Service Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of services associated with the appointments.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start At</strong><strong><br></strong>The start date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End At </strong><strong><br></strong>The end date timestamp of the appointment in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the purchase associated with the appointments.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the appointments.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID associated with the location.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Duration</strong><strong><br></strong>The duration of the appointments in minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Booked By</strong><strong><br></strong>Who booked the appointment, e.g., <em>Client</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVYF76YT44WM424XY8S\">Membership metrics</h2>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVYS653BVB03FSRC4F6\">Activated Membership</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client activates a membership.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start On</strong><br>The date the membership goes into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End On</strong><strong><br></strong>The date the membership expires into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Cancel On</strong><strong><br></strong>The timestamp of the date the membership is scheduled to be canceled (if applicable) in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Status</strong><strong><br></strong>The status of the client’s membership in Boulevard.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Price</strong><strong><br></strong>The total cost of the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Membership Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of the names of the membership plans activated.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vouchers</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of any vouchers the client redeemed with their membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVYJGA27MK3E963QYHK\">Canceled Membership</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client cancels a membership.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start On</strong><br>The date the membership goes into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End On</strong><strong><br></strong>The date the membership expires into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Cancel On</strong><strong><br></strong>The timestamp of the date the membership is scheduled to be canceled (if applicable) in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Status</strong><strong><br></strong>The status of the client’s membership in Boulevard.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Price</strong><strong><br></strong>The total cost of the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Membership Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of the names of members associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vouchers</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of any vouchers the client redeemed with their membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVY08MEV3N1BTR7B69C\">Reactivated Membership</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client reactivates a membership that was canceled.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start On</strong><br>The date the membership goes into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End On</strong><strong><br></strong>The date the membership expires into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Cancel On</strong><strong><br></strong>The timestamp of the date the membership is scheduled to be canceled (if applicable) in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Status</strong><strong><br></strong>The status of the client’s membership in Boulevard.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Price</strong><strong><br></strong>The total cost of the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Membership Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of the names of members associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vouchers</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of any vouchers the client redeemed with their membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVYMB8Z4EJK0X6WD9DE\">Paused Membership</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client pauses a membership to be reactivated at a later time.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start On</strong><br>The date the membership goes into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End On</strong><strong><br></strong>The date the membership expires into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Cancel On</strong><strong><br></strong>The timestamp of the date the membership is scheduled to be canceled (if applicable) in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Status</strong><strong><br></strong>The status of the client’s membership in Boulevard.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Price</strong><strong><br></strong>The total cost of the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Membership Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of the names of members associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vouchers</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of any vouchers the client redeemed with their membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVYEX0X6XD37018WJE6\">Unpaused Membership</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client unpauses a membership.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Start On</strong><br>The date the membership goes into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>End On<br></strong>The date the membership expires into effect in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Cancel On</strong><strong><br></strong>The timestamp of the date the membership is scheduled to be canceled (if applicable) in UTC format, i.e., <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mmTZD.</em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Status</strong><strong><br></strong>The status of the client’s membership in Boulevard.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the location associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Price</strong><strong><br></strong>The total cost of the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Membership Names</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of the names of members associated with the membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vouchers</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of any vouchers the client redeemed with their membership.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVY7NG3BMZ0PXH58GRQ\">Other metrics</h2>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVZAJ5SZEGEWKED1C2F\">Placed Order</h3>\n<p>This event is tracked when a client places an order through Boulevard and the payment is complete. Orders can include retail products, gift cards, or services.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Applied Vouchers</strong><br>The list of any vouchers applied to the purchase.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Closed By</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the staff member who closed the purchase.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The order ID associated with the purchase.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location Name</strong><strong><br></strong>The name of the location associated with the order.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Location ID</strong><strong><br></strong>The ID of the location associated with the order.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Order Number</strong><strong><br></strong>The unique number associated with the order.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Summary</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of payment details including discounts, gratuity, subtotal, and total.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Line Groups</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of items associated with the order.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Note</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of any notes associated with the order.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Refunds</strong><strong><br></strong>The list of any items that were refunded.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Total</strong><strong><br></strong>The total value of the order.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HGVDSQVZ59MF39KRDH2F00R3\">Synced client data</h2>\n<p>Klaviyo creates or updates profiles for every client with Email, First and Last Name, Phone Number, and will set a custom profile properties of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Appointment Count</strong><br>Total count of appointments.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Boulevard ID</strong><br>ID assigned to the client in Boulevard.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Email Marketing</strong><strong><br></strong>Whether or not a client has opted-in to receive marketing emails. (true/false)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>SMS Marketing</strong><strong><br></strong>Whether or not a client has opted-in to receive marketing SMS. (true/false)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Push Marketing</strong><strong><br></strong>Whether or not a client can receive marketing push notifications. (true/false)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Email Reminder</strong><strong><br></strong>Whether or not a client can receive transactional emails. (true/false)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>SMS Reminder</strong><strong><br></strong>Whether or not a client can receive transactional SMS. (true/false)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Push Reminder</strong><strong><br></strong>Whether or not a client can receive transactional push notifications. (true/false)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Boulevard Tags</strong><strong><br></strong>Any tags assigned to the client in Boulevard.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Birthday</strong><strong><br></strong>The client’s date of birth.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Primary Location Name<br></strong>The client’s primary location for receiving services.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Primary Location ID<br></strong>The ID of the client’s primary location.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Klaviyo also syncs email and SMS consent from Boulevard to Klaviyo profiles. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8JG4RH31E033X2QAW8VRCE4\">Additional resources</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/16131320434459\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Getting started with Boulevard</a></p>",
